# Model artifacts must retain their exact bytes and use binary diffs.
#
# They are ordinary blobs and not Git LFS pointers, on purpose: one clone is everything the offline
# build needs, with no second download and no tool besides git. The price is that every version of
# a model stays in the history for good, and a retrained one adds its whole size again. So a model
# is committed when a release ships it.
*.onnx binary
